</style><h2>Blinky 1.5.5</h2><ul><li><strong>The card says when a limit may run out.</strong> Settings → Notifications → Exhaustion forecast. Within six hours it names the window and a rough time, for example “Weekly · may run out in about 4 hours”; further out it can say the pace may not last until the reset. Notifications start with one warning at 24 hours left, and more stages can be added. Codex’s 5-hour and weekly windows are included when the reply states a length and a reset. <a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/pull/61">#61</a></li></ul><p><a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/releases/tag/v1.5.5">Release notes on GitHub</a></p>]]></description>
